","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-appraisal:line053:m0019","quote":"和"}],"identity_note":"孫權子，登死後立為太子；張承之婿。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032","quote":"承字仲嗣，少以才學知名，與諸葛瑾、歩騭、嚴畯相友善。權爲驃騎將軍，辟西曹掾，出爲長沙西部都尉。討平山寇，得精兵萬五千人。後爲濡須都督、奮威將軍，封都鄕侯，領部曲五千人。承爲人壯毅忠讜，能甄識人物，拔彭城蔡款、南陽謝景於孤微童幼，後並爲國士，款至衞尉，景豫章太守。又諸葛恪年少時，眾人奇其英才。承言終敗諸葛氏者，元遜也。勤於長進，篤於物類，凡在庶幾之流，無不造門，年六十七，赤烏七年卒，謚曰定侯。子震嗣。初，承喪妻，昭欲爲索諸葛瑾女，承以相與有好，難之，權聞而勸焉，遂爲婿。生女，權爲子和納之。權數令和修敬於承，執子婿之禮。震諸葛恪誅時亦死。","source_term":"權爲子和納之"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu052-zc-he","interpretation_note":"本來源明記世代。後綴只供識別。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"572_278_cba"}},{"id":"572_278_cba_AA","label":"孫德","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","review":"ai_provisional","aliases":[{"surface":"德","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-059-he:line036-pei02-01:m0012","c-sanguozhi-059-he:line036-pei02-01:m0024"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-059","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-he","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-059-he","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-he:line036-pei02-01","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-he:line036-pei02-01:m0012","quote":"德"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-059","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-he","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-059-he","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-he:line036-pei02-01","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-he:line036-pei02-01:m0024","quote":"德"}],"identity_note":"依本篇具名、稱謂及其所在原句辨認；引書原字存於各自來源。","family_path":{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"572_278_cba_A","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-059","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-he","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-059-he","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-he:line036-pei02-01","quote":"《吳歷》曰：和四子：皓、德、謙、俊。孫休即位，封德錢唐侯，謙永安侯，俊拜騎都尉。皓在武昌，吳興施但因民之不堪命，聚萬餘人，劫謙，將至秣陵，欲立之。未至三十里住，擇吉日，但遣使以謙命詔丁固、諸葛靚。靚即斬其使。但遂前到九里，固、靚出擊，大破之。但兵裸身無鎧甲，臨陣皆披散。謙獨坐車中，遂生獲之。固不敢殺，以狀告皓，皓酖之，母子皆死。俊，張承外孫，聦明辨惠，爲遠近所稱，皓又殺之。","source_term":"和四子：皓、德、謙、俊"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu059-he-5","interpretation_note":"本句所記父子；識別後綴不表示長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-sanguozhi-059-he","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-059","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-he","raw_mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-059-he:line036-pei02-01:m0012","c-sanguozhi-059-he:line036-pei02-01:m0024"],"paragraph_ids":["c-sanguozhi-059-he:line036-pei02-01"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-he:line036-pei02-01:m0012","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-059-he:line036-pei02-01:m0012"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-he:line036-pei02-01:m0024","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-059-he:line036-pei02-01:m0024"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":2,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":2,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"2處獨立位置，2個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-sanguozhi-059-he"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-wu059-he-5","subject_person_id":"572_278_cba_AA","object_person_id":"572_278_cba_A","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"和四子：皓、德、謙、俊"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b